<title>UK: LME - warehouse stock movements.</title>
<headline>LME - warehouse stock movements.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Jul 30 - Latest LME warehouse stock changes are: copper up 6350, tin down 30, lead up 275, zinc down 1325, aluminium down 1600, nickel down 138, aluminium alloy down 240</p>
